      <title>ChatGPT反复运行让品牌AI可见性变成随机变量</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/gpt/post/20260831/ChatGPT%E5%8F%8D%E5%A4%8D%E8%BF%90%E8%A1%8C%E8%AE%A9%E5%93%81%E7%89%8CAI%E5%8F%AF%E8%A7%81%E6%80%A7%E5%8F%98%E6%88%90%E9%9A%8F%E6%9C%BA%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F/</link>
